/P 317 0 R
/E (System analysis is an important phase in software development that focuses on studying the existing system, identifying its limitations, understanding security challenges, and developing an improved solution to overcome those problems. In cybersecurity-based applications, system analysis plays a major role in identifying vulnerabilities, weak monitoring mechanisms, and integrity risks that may lead to cyberattacks or unauthorized data modifications.)
/Pg 29 0 R
