/P 320 0 R
/E (The project also includes attack simulation functionality to demonstrate how cyberattacks affect retail transaction records. Simulated malicious entries can be injected into monitored files to imitate real-world tampering attacks. The forensic engine automatically identifies these modifications and updates the dashboard with threat alerts. This functionality helps validate the effectiveness of the monitoring system and provides practical understanding of digital forensic investigation techniques.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [8]
>>
