/E (The implementation of SHA-256 cryptographic hashing significantly improved the accuracy of file integrity verification. Even small modifications within transaction files generated completely different hash values, allowing the system to identify unauthorized changes effectively. The forensic monitoring engine successfully detected simulated cyberattacks and updated the dashboard with real-time alerts whenever integrity violations occurred.)
/Pg 68 0 R
/K [3]
>>
